      "index": 151,
      "start": 317.62,
      "end": 320.04,
      "dur": 2.42,
      "sub": "right after announcing the five-day week.",
      "spec": "scene:47_worlds_work_magazine.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": 320.04,
      "end": 323.26,
      "dur": 3.22,
      "sub": "People who have more leisure must have more clothes.",
      "spec": "scene:110_wardrobe_clothes_rack_shopping.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "start": 323.26,
      "end": 325.68,
      "dur": 2.42,
      "sub": "They must have a greater variety of food.",
      "spec": "scene:111_weekend_diner_feast_table.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "start": 325.68,
      "end": 328.52,
      "dur": 2.84,
      "sub": "They must have more transportation facilities.",
      "spec": "scene:112_family_highway_roadtrip_model_t.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "start": 328.52,
      "end": 330.42,
      "dur": 1.9,
      "sub": "This increased consumption will require",
      "spec": "scene:106_overflowing_model_t_parking_lot.png+check_on:1620,200"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "start": 330.42,
      "end": 333.12,
      "dur": 2.7,
      "sub": "greater production than we now have.",
      "spec": "scene:05_ford_1926_model_t_shopping.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "start": 333.12,
      "end": 334.64,
      "dur": 1.52,
      "sub": "Read that again.",
      "spec": "host:03_pose_shocked_hands_head.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "start": 334.64,
      "end": 336.78,
      "dur": 2.14,
      "sub": "Saturday was not given back so you could",
      "spec": "scene:48_tree_vs_shopping_split.png+reveal_left:960"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "start": 336.78,
      "end": 339.78,
      "dur": 3.0,
      "sub": "sit under a tree like an ancient hunter -gatherer.",
      "spec": "scene:48_tree_vs_shopping_split.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "start": 339.78,
      "end": 341.64,
      "dur": 1.86,
      "sub": "Saturday was invented so you",
      "spec": "scene:113_saturday_mall_cash_register.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "start": 341.64,
      "end": 343.64,
      "dur": 2.0,
      "sub": "would have time to go shopping.",
      "spec": "scene:113_saturday_mall_cash_register.png+closeup:720,460,1.32"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "start": 343.64,
      "end": 345.78,
      "dur": 2.14,
      "sub": "One day for rest on Sunday.",
      "spec": "scene:114_three_part_week_cycle_diagram.png+reveal_col1"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "start": 345.78,
      "end": 348.5,
      "dur": 2.72,
      "sub": "One day to spend your paycheck on Saturday.",
      "spec": "scene:114_three_part_week_cycle_diagram.png+reveal_col2"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "start": 348.5,
      "end": 351.7,
      "dur": 3.2,
      "sub": "And five days to earn it all back again.",
      "spec": "scene:114_three_part_week_cycle_diagram.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "start": 351.7,
      "end": 352.78,
      "dur": 1.08,
      "sub": "And here is the part of the",
      "spec": "scene:115_school_classroom_censored_history.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "start": 352.78,
      "end": 355.56,
      "dur": 2.78,
      "sub": "story almost nobody gets taught in school.",
      "spec": "scene:115_school_classroom_censored_history.png+closeup:960,460,1.32"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "start": 355.56,
      "end": 361.28,
      "dur": 5.72,
      "sub": "In the 1930s, nobody believed the five-day 40-hour week was the final destination.",
      "spec": "scene:49_keynes_road_fork.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "start": 361.28,
      "end": 364.92,
      "dur": 3.64,
      "sub": "Everybody thought it was just a temporary stop on the way down.",
      "spec": "scene:116_downward_stairs_60_48_40_15.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "start": 364.92,
      "end": 367.56,
      "dur": 2.64,
      "sub": "In 1930, economist John Maynard Keynes",
      "spec": "scene:25_keynes_1930_15hrs_chalkboard.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "start": 367.56,
      "end": 371.08,
      "dur": 3.52,
      "sub": "calculated that with technology advancing so fast,",
      "spec": "scene:117_keynes_grandchildren_3hr_beach.png+reveal_left:820"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "start": 371.08,
      "end": 373.64,
      "dur": 2.56,
      "sub": "his grandchildren would only need to work about 15",
      "spec": "scene:117_keynes_grandchildren_3hr_beach.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "start": 373.64,
      "end": 376.64,
      "dur": 3.0,
      "sub": "hours a week \u2014 maybe three hours a day.",
      "spec": "scene:117_keynes_grandchildren_3hr_beach.png+closeup:1320,480,1.35"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "start": 376.64,
      "end": 380.52,
      "dur": 3.88,
      "sub": "And in April 1933, at the height of the Great Depression,",
      "spec": "scene:118_1933_depression_soup_line_capitol.png"
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "start": 380.52,
      "end": 382.3,
      "dur": 1.78,
      "sub": "the U .S. Senate actually voted on",
      "spec": "scene:50_hugo_black_30hr_bill.png"
    },
